<title>USA: Entremed names Nelson Campbell CFO.</title>
<headline>Entremed names Nelson Campbell CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>EntreMed Inc said it named Nelson Campbell, a former mergers and acquisitions executive from Daiwa Securities Co Ltd's Daiwa America Securities Inc, as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Campbell replaces John Thomas, who served as EntreMed's interim CFO since the company's 1991 founding.  He will continue at EntreMed as Secretary/Treasurer, Entremed said.</p>
<p>The company also said it promoted Edward Gubish to head its research and development operations.  He was most recently vice president of Regulatory and Clinical Development.</p>
